     "explanation": "The 75% H / 25% He ratio is observed in old, unprocessed gas clouds across the universe — confirming BBN's prediction with stunning accuracy. The same theory predicts trace amounts of deuterium, helium-3, and lithium-7 in precise ratios that we also confirm. This is one of three pillars of the Big Bang (alongside Hubble expansion and the CMB) and constrains the universe's age and density extraordinarily tightly.",
