"20\">Pluto, Eris, Haumea, Makemake</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"735\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Ceres (asteroid belt)</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"770\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Many more candidates being characterized</text><rect x=\"200\" y=\"830\" width=\"700\" height=\"210\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"875\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">NEW HORIZONS LESSON</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"920\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">\"Dwarf\" does not mean unimportant</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"955\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Pluto is geologically rich and fascinating</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"990\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">A complex world worth multiple missions</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"1025\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Classification is about taxonomy, not value</text></svg>",
