"start\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"16\">Lifetime: trillions of years</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"745\" width=\"940\" height=\"120\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.12)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"160\" y=\"790\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">THE PLANETS</text><text x=\"160\" y=\"825\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">All Earth-sized; 3 in HZ; orbital resonance 1:2:3</text><text x=\"160\" y=\"850\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"16\">Tightly packed; outermost at 0.06 AU</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"880\" width=\"940\" height=\"160\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.12)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"925\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">JWST FINDINGS (2023-25)</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"970\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">TRAPPIST-1 b: NO substantial atmosphere</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"1005\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Stellar flares strip atmospheres of M-dwarf planets</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"1035\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"16\">e is the best remaining HZ candidate</text></svg>",
      "caption": "TRAPPIST-1: tightest study of habitability"
