     "type": "practice",
     "title": "Practice Problem: Estimate the Drake N",
     "content": "**Goal**: do the back-of-envelope calculation that has launched 1,000 SETI papers.\n\n**Use these (somewhat optimistic) values**:\n• R* = 3 stars formed per year\n• fp = 1.0 (all stars have planets — Kepler result)\n• ne = 0.5 (one habitable planet per 2 stars)\n• fl = 0.1 (life on 1 in 10 habitable planets)\n• fi = 0.01 (intelligence on 1 in 100 life-bearing worlds)\n• fc = 0.1 (1 in 10 reach broadcast tech)\n• L = 10,000 years (civilizations last ~10 millennia broadcasting)\n\n**N = 3 × 1.0 × 0.5 × 0.1 × 0.01 × 0.1 × 10,000**\nN = 3 × 0.05 × 0.001 × 0.1 × 10,000\nN = 0.00015 × 10,000\n**N = 1.5** civilizations actively broadcasting in our galaxy right now.\n\n**Pessimistic variant** (fl=0.001, fi=0.0001, L=200): N ≈ **3 × 10⁻¹⁰** — essentially zero.\n\n**Optimistic variant** (fl=1, fi=0.1, L=1,000,000): N ≈ **150,000** civilizations.\n\n**Reflection**: the answer ranges from \"alone\" to \"crowded.\" The middle factors are our **ignorance**, and the equation's value is making that ignorance **quantitatively visible**. Sagan called this *\"the most beautiful question in science.\"*\n\n**Now try your own values**. Defend each one. What does your N say about what we should do?",
     "visual": {
      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">PRACTICE PROBLEM</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">Computing N with the Drake Equation</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"170\" width=\"900\" height=\"160\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"215\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">FORMULA</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"260\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">N = R* × fp × ne × fl × fi × fc × L</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"300\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">7 factors, multiplied</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"350\" width=\"900\" height=\"200\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"395\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">MODERATE VALUES</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"440\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">R*=3, fp=1.0, ne=0.5</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"470\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">fl=0.1, fi=0.01, fc=0.1, L=10,000</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"510\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">N ≈ 1.5</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"540\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Just us + maybe one other</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"570\" width=\"900\" height=\"160\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.12)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"615\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">PESSIMISTIC</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"660\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">N ≈ 3 × 10⁻¹⁰</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">essentially alone in the galaxy</text><rect x=\"100\" y=\"750\" width=\"900\" height=\"160\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.12)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"795\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">OPTIMISTIC</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"840\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"22\">N ≈ 150,000</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"880\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">a populated galaxy</text><rect x=\"200\" y=\"930\" width=\"700\" height=\"110\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"975\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">YOUR N TELLS A STORY</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"1015\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">about what we should do next</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Try your own Drake estimates"
     }
