      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">KNOWLEDGE CHECK</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">Cosmic fate under constant Λ</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"170\" width=\"940\" height=\"120\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.12)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"215\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">TODAY (13.8 Gyr)</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"252\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">DE dominates; expansion accelerating</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"280\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">You are here</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"305\" width=\"940\" height=\"120\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.12)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"350\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">100 BILLION YEARS</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"387\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Galaxies beyond Local Group invisible</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"415\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Beyond the cosmic event horizon</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"440\" width=\"940\" height=\"120\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"485\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">10¹⁴ YEARS</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"522\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Last stars burn out; star formation ends</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"550\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Universe goes dark</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"575\" width=\"940\" height=\"120\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"620\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">10⁶⁷ YEARS</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"657\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Solar-mass black holes evaporate</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"685\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">via Hawking radiation</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"710\" width=\"940\" height=\"120\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(236,72,153,0.12)\" stroke=\"#ec4899\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"755\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ec4899\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">10¹⁰⁰ YEARS</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"792\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Supermassive BHs gone — heat death</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"820\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Maximum entropy, no structure</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"850\" width=\"940\" height=\"100\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(239,68,68,0.12)\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"895\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ef4444\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">NOT A BIG CRUNCH</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"930\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">Old idea ruled out by 1998 supernova data</text><rect x=\"200\" y=\"965\" width=\"700\" height=\"80\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"1010\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"22\">If Λ changes (DESI), fate may differ</text></svg>",
