      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">HYDROTHERMAL VENTS</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">Life's possible cradle — and Europa's too?</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"170\" width=\"940\" height=\"160\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"215\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">1977 — DEEP-SEA VENTS DISCOVERED</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"260\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Submersible Alvin, Galápagos rift</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"295\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Ecosystems thriving in dark, 350 °C, toxic water</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"325\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Powered by chemistry, not sunlight</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"350\" width=\"940\" height=\"160\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.12)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"395\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">ALKALINE VENTS — LIFE'S CRADLE?</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"440\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Natural proton gradients (like ATP synthesis)</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"475\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Mineral pores act like cells</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"505\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Russell 2003 hypothesis, Lane &amp; Martin 2014 detail</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"530\" width=\"940\" height=\"180\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"575\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">LOST CITY (Atlantic, 2000)</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"620\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Real alkaline vent system</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"655\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Operating ≥ 30,000 years continuously</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"690\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Best candidate for early Earth analog</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"730\" width=\"940\" height=\"180\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.12)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"775\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">ASTROBIOLOGY CONNECTION</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"820\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Europa and Enceladus have subsurface oceans</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"855\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Likely have hydrothermal vents</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"890\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Cradle of life may be common in icy worlds</text><rect x=\"200\" y=\"940\" width=\"700\" height=\"100\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"985\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">ASK ENCELADUS</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"1020\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Cassini sampled plumes — organics confirmed</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Vents as life's cradle — on Earth and beyond"
