      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">KNOWLEDGE CHECK</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">Why RNA World is compelling</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"170\" width=\"940\" height=\"220\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"215\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">CHICKEN-AND-EGG PROBLEM</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"260\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">DNA stores info, but needs proteins to copy</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"295\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Proteins do work, but need DNA's instructions</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"335\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Neither can come first</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"370\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Until RNA</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"410\" width=\"940\" height=\"220\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.12)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"455\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">RNA DOES BOTH</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"500\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Stores info via base sequence</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"535\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Catalyzes reactions (ribozymes)</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"575\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Could potentially replicate itself</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"610\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">No proteins needed initially</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"650\" width=\"940\" height=\"160\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"695\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">EVIDENCE TODAY</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"740\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Ribosome IS an RNA enzyme</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"775\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Self-replicating RNA has been demonstrated</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"830\" width=\"940\" height=\"120\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(245,158,11,0.12)\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"875\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">STILL OPEN</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"910\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"18\">No complete RNA-only cell created yet</text><rect x=\"200\" y=\"970\" width=\"700\" height=\"70\" rx=\"15\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"1015\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-size=\"22\">Strongest framework, not yet fully proven</text></svg>",
      "caption": "RNA breaks the chicken-and-egg deadlock"
