      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" class=\"lesson-visual\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"36\">KNOWLEDGE CHECK</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"115\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"24\">Why alkaline vents are compelling</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"170\" width=\"940\" height=\"200\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(99,102,241,0.12)\" stroke=\"#6366f1\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"215\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#6366f1\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">PROTON GRADIENTS</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"265\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Mineral walls separate acidic ocean</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"300\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">from alkaline vent fluid</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"335\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Natural energy gradient — no enzymes needed</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"390\" width=\"940\" height=\"200\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(139,92,246,0.12)\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"435\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">MODERN CELLS DO THE SAME THING</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"485\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">ATP synthesis uses proton gradient</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"525\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">across inner mitochondrial membrane</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"560\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Conserved across all life</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"610\" width=\"940\" height=\"200\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(16,185,129,0.12)\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"655\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#10b981\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">PLUS RICH CHEMISTRY</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">H₂, CO₂, mineral catalysts</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"735\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Mineral pores act like proto-cells</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"770\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Continuous over millennia</text><rect x=\"80\" y=\"830\" width=\"940\" height=\"210\" rx=\"20\" fill=\"rgba(255,215,0,0.1)\" stroke=\"#ffd700\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"875\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#ffd700\" font-weight=\"bold\" font-size=\"22\">ASTROBIOLOGY IMPLICATION</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"920\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Europa, Enceladus may have same conditions</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"960\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#fff\" font-size=\"20\">Life's cradle could be common</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"1000\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"20\">in icy worlds with subsurface oceans</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"1030\" text-anchor=\"middle\" fill=\"#888\" font-size=\"18\">Cassini already found organics at Enceladus</text></svg>",
