     "explanation": "Sagan's deepest message, repeated across Cosmos, Pale Blue Dot, Demon-Haunted World, and his life's work: the universe is COMPREHENSIBLE (not magic), we are PART OF IT (not separate observers), and the proper response combines WONDER with RIGOR. Science is not finished — that would be anti-Sagan — but it makes progress. We are not central (Pale Blue Dot) but we are also not insignificant (we are conscious cosmos). And science is for everyone — Sagan's whole career was making it public. This synthesis is the seminar's takeaway in one sentence.",
