     "explanation": "Sagan's specific quantitative predictions varied in accuracy — but his BROADER FRAMEWORK has been overwhelmingly vindicated. He argued: (1) the universe is comprehensible via physics; (2) life emerges from chemistry given the right conditions; (3) science makes steady progress; (4) cosmic perspective transforms human self-understanding. Every one of these has been deepened by 21st-century discoveries. JWST sees galaxies forming, exoplanets are common, biosignature science is real, dark energy makes us humble. Sagan's framework is the scaffolding that holds modern science together — that is his lasting validation.",
